talking about the revolution

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:16.080
and yet I think it's
critical to have physicians

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.530
and health systems really
actively engaged in this.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:23.230
And in my world what this is increasingly

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:27.000
especially with young
students, younger students,

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:30.170
residents kind of more junior faculty

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:32.420
