we just don't know much about his health.

00:44:24.820 --> 00:44:26.740
Like when he comes down to it,

00:44:26.740 --> 00:44:29.360
we don't know much about the
health of young black men.

00:44:29.360 --> 00:44:32.940
We don't know much about
