01:15:17.320 --> 01:15:18.820
and one of my students are out one

01:15:18.820 --> 01:15:21.250
that my students are always asking me

01:15:21.250 --> 01:15:23.670
is what can we do, right?

01:15:23.670 --> 01:15:26.882
What can we do to support this work?

01:15:26.882 --> 01:15:31.882
And what's at stake if we
